---
description: Budget files block paid calls when their status says so.
globs: config/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

`config/budget.yaml` is the spend gate. If Higgsfield status is `blocked`, or `hold` is set, do not submit a generation. A remaining credit balance is not a cap. A website Unlimited label, or a model that lists `supports_unlim`, does not make an MCP call free when the account says unlimited is unavailable. If an ElevenLabs total would pass `ask_before_credits`, stop and ask. Never write a secret value into these files.
